// FarmLedger - Who does what
// Eraser: New diagram > "Flow Chart" > paste
direction right

Farmer [icon: user, color: green]
Insurance agent [icon: user, color: blue]
Insurance company [icon: briefcase, color: blue]
Veterinarian [icon: activity, color: blue]
Government [icon: flag, color: red]
Weather and satellite data [icon: sun, color: orange]
Mobile Money [icon: dollar-sign, color: orange]

FarmLedger [color: lightblue] {
  Sign up [shape: oval]
  Apply for insurance [shape: oval]
  Approve or turn down application [shape: oval]
  Accept offer and pay [shape: oval]
  Report a loss [shape: oval]
  Check a claim [shape: oval]
  Get paid [shape: oval]
  Receive text updates [shape: oval]
  Support premiums [shape: oval]
}

Farmer > Sign up
Farmer > Accept offer and pay
Farmer > Report a loss
Farmer > Receive text updates
Insurance agent > Apply for insurance: on behalf of the farmer
Insurance company > Approve or turn down application
Insurance company > Check a claim: crop losses
Veterinarian > Check a claim: cattle deaths
Government > Support premiums: pays part of the cost
Weather and satellite data > Get paid: drought or flood pays automatically

Apply for insurance > Approve or turn down application
Approve or turn down application > Accept offer and pay
Report a loss > Check a claim
Check a claim > Get paid: if confirmed
Accept offer and pay > Mobile Money
Get paid > Mobile Money
